Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.44,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4C39DA&\3c&HC9C9C9&\bord1\fry-20\frz3.503\fax-0.1\pos(241,67.5)}Harumotoya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.44,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So you want to know \Nwhere Yuki's little sister is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.77,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I have no idea, for the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:06.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No fair only admitting that \N{\i1}after{\i0} I bought you ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:10.57,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Simply asking me for information \Nis worth at least that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:14.16,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The only leads you have are that bell \Nand that her name is "Hua," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:17.83,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll put in exactly one bowl of ramen's \Nworth of effort, so... don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:21.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Also, what kind of teacher \Nmakes a student pay for their—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:24.58,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't distract me when \NI'm getting my ramen on. 'Kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:36.18,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, man. Japanese noodles sure taste \Ndifferent when they're the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.82,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So much better than sushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:40.34,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,This is probably 80% of the reason \Nwhy I'm still in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.48,0:00:43.56,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Yuki, you get where I'm coming from, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:50.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Y-You... Y-You... Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Stop looking so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:56.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I knew you loved this \NKatsuda's Sauce stuff, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I didn't know you carried around \Nyour own personal supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:02.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's like how some people get extra garlic, \Nright? Ms. Yuki has hers with extra sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:03.79,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Apologize to the ramen, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:07.01,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If you want the information, \Ngo without the sauce next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.52,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Otherwise, no deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:10.96,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's only a little bit of sauce left...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:43.18,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H28287A&\3c&HC0C1CB&\frz8.725\fax-0.2\move(325,240,335.5,240,25,2153)}Katsuda Side Dish Store
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.18,DefaultTop,FUKU,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:45.68,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\blur1\pos(604.5,280.5)}Episode {\c&H2531C6&}8{\c&H000000&}: The Autumn With {\c&H2531C6&}You{\c&H000000&} and the Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.68,DefaultTop,FUKU,0,0,0,,We're all sold out of the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:51.07,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,The students have been buying it up, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.16,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:53.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The Katsuda Festival's coming up, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.29,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ms. Maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:03:00.01,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Around this time of the year, \Nit's hard to make enough to meet demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:02.25,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,We have a lot of back orders, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:05.68,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,so you'll need to wait about a week \Nbefore you can buy more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:06.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,One whole week...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.52,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:16.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, no... Thank you for always \Nmaking your delicious s-sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.59,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This is the most character development \NI've seen from her yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:26.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hm... Yeah, it's gonna be tough \Nmaking this much last a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:29.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will cherish... every drop...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:32.69,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I need to think of some way to cheer her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, come to think of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:38.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you met your little sister again, \Nwhat would you want to talk to her about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:44.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My memories of my childhood are vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:47.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even my sister's face is hazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:50.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and I only remember fragments of my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:54.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was all alone before I even \Nknew what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:57.00,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But I remember this bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:01.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My mother gave one to both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:06.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I thought maybe my sister would \Nfind me if I held onto it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:11.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but nothing so miraculous \Nhas happened over these past ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:15.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm actually scared to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:20.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It may be that my little sister \Nholds a grudge against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:25.31,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no... Did I do the wrong thing \Nasking Grace for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.95,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:34.67,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Even if we don't meet, just knowing that \Nmy little sister is safe would make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:36.62,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:42.89,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I tried to console her, but she \Nended up reassuring me instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.08,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,S'up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:46.16,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Yuki, you have a little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:49.05,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,I bet she's as beautiful as you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Taiga?! Kobachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:52.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:56.98,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Hey, now, do I need to remind you that \NNazca's new album dropped today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:04:57.77,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,On top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:01.39,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this autographed \Nlimited edition I won in a lottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:03.82,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,It's god-tier! Thank you, world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:06.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Isn't Nazca that singer who's \Nattending the Katsuda Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.16,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.16,0:05:09.96,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,You guys shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:13.33,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,You two sure are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:18.46,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, you've had a lot of \Nrelatives suddenly show up lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:20.43,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's all a bit much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:22.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What can I say? It's a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:24.11,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,While we, your dear friends, \Nare thrown aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:27.30,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Come on, Kobachi, it's all right. \NDon't be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:29.96,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,If anything, I'm grateful to you, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.35,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Ever since you showed up, Hitoyoshi \Nseems like he's been having lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi has?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.64,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,You bet! He was a real mess \Nduring middle school, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:42.00,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,Only we know what he was like then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.33,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,He was rebelling against his dad \N{\i1}and{\i0} going through his edgy phase,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.49,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,and man, he sure was a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:50.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"Edgy phase"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.94,DefaultTop,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Remember how he'd always wear a black \Ntrench coat, even in the middle of summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:56.71,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fad(613,1)\fnArial Black\c&H7E86BC&\3c&H1F265C&\bord1\frz21.65\pos(230.5,323)}Chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:55.79,DefaultTop,TAIGA,0,0,0,,He called himself "The Angry Knife"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:58.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"The Angry Knife"...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:03.92,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's so embarrassing to have this come out now \Nafter Ms. Yuki's {\i0}actual{\i1} dark past...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:07.57,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Do you know why he stopped cleaning \Nthe house in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.57,0:06:10.39,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,It wasn't that he didn't know how, \Nhe was just such a brat that—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Taiga! If you say one more \Nword, I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:17.73,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My autographed CD!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:24.61,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H252E31&}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:33.49,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\c&H252E31&\frz173.7\pos(217.5,160.5)\blur0.2\t(1524,2066,\blur1.5)}Katsuda's\NSauce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.46,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\fnTimes New Roman\c&H0D100E&\3c&HF5FDFB&\pos(259,221.5)}FIN
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.54,0:06:41.50,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(442,1)\fs40\fnTimes New Roman\c&HF7FAF9&\pos(320,35)}That night...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:51.14,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs26\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H413F51&\3c&HF1EEF0&}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:51.14,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,That hurt... I can't believe \Nyou'd treat me that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.06,Default,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:56.58,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,I don't think I can let you lick me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, feel free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:07.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, did you just wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's almost lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:13.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,K-Katsuda's Sauce hates me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:18.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's no point in living anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,All right. Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:26.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I see... Katsuda's Sauce \Nspoke to you in your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:31.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You'll be able to buy more next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:34.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes... That may be so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:36.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but that's not the only thing I dreamt of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:40.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What? You have other scary dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:41.56,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:52.15,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(526,1)\bord2.5\pos(320,255)\c&H232626&\3c&HF0F3F1&}The next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.15,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:55.32,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(526,1)\bord2.5\pos(320,255)\c&H232626&\3c&HF0F3F1&}And the day after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.23,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:06.21,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,C-Could you please sleep next to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:07.25,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:09.59,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,A-A distress signal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.86,0:08:11.69,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm scared to sleep, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:14.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm scared that I can't sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,P-Putting sleeping arrangements aside for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:22.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I already know I'm going to be up late \Ncramming for the test tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:25.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so I guess we could talk \Nuntil you feel ready to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:28.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Could you please do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.01,0:08:42.66,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:48.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,you are very kind, and the people \Naround you care for you dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You are a very personable person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:53.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? What's all this all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:54.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:08:58.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um... Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Have you ever felt hatred toward anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:03.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Do I hate anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:09.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hate, huh... Dunno if I've ever felt strongly \Nenough about anyone to call it hate, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:11.69,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If I had to choose, it'd probably be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:14.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,my dad, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:16.34,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's not that I hate him exactly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:20.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Lots of things happened in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and that's why I'm keeping \Nmy distance, in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's just something that \Ncomes with being family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:30.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Something that comes with being family...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:32.00,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,I hate you, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:52.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Um, I think I'll return to my room, so as not \Nto interfere with your studies any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:53.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:16.80,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs26\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H413F51&\3c&HF1EEF0&}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:06.46,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,It's all your fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.64,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:11.46,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,You threw me away, just like you \Nthrew your little sister away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:16.80,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,You only know how to kill people, \Nand that's why everyone hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:22.17,Default,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,That's not true... I'm doing my best... \NI'm trying to be a normal—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:25.66,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,Even now, you're causing trouble \Nfor Hitoyoshi and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.70,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:31.15,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,He doesn't really want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:35.28,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,Everything that's happened has been your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.60,Flashback,INTERVIEWER,0,0,0,,How old are you, Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.20,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,I turn seven next month on the 25th.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:45.16,Flashback,INTERVIEWER,0,0,0,,I heard you can speak 15 languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:48.32,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes! I learned them so I could help my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.26,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,When you were young, you were a prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.29,Flashback,INTERVIEWER,0,0,0,,It seems your mother works as an interpreter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:55.34,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:58.62,Flashback,INTERVIEWER,0,0,0,,My goodness, Maria, you're answering \Nall of the questions so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:01.58,Flashback,INTERVIEWER,0,0,0,,Is this also something \Nyou learned from your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:02.58,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:06.26,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,My mom is beautiful and smart, \Nand she has a wonderful smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:10.97,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,Your observational skills were superb, \Nyou had a photographic memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:13.87,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,and your athletic ability was \Nfar beyond that of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.08,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,You were in the spotlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:20.33,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,but you lacked interest in \Nyour talents or the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:23.84,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,The only things you had eyes for were...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.58,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.74,0:11:32.50,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,the smiles on your beloved parents' faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:38.73,Flashback,EVERYONE BESIDES YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.55,Flashback,FATHER; MOTHER; HUA,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:46.93,Flashback,MOTHER,0,0,0,,There's some on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:54.36,Flashback,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Do we have guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.84,Flashback,FATHER,0,0,0,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:59.35,Flashback,MOTHER,0,0,0,,I will, too. You girls keep eating, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.23,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.98,0:12:32.15,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't go... Mom... Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:36.19,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't go... Stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.77,0:12:39.15,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,It's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:42.83,Flashback,YOUNG YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:47.42,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,In order to kidnap you, the child prodigy, \Nyour parents were murdered,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:50.20,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,and your sister was caught up \Nin the whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.53,0:12:54.36,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,The loss of your loved ones \Nrobbed you of your emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:59.25,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,and that fixation of yours shifted \Nfrom your parents to your sister, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:01.71,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.26,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.65,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:07.51,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,I hate you, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:08.93,Flashback,HUA,0,0,0,,And I don't want this bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.98,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,Soon, you were rejected by your sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:23.30,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,and the only thing left for you \Nwas the life of an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.72,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,In order to survive, you continued to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.91,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,and before you knew it, \Nyou were living only to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:34.37,Default,SAUCE,0,0,0,,You became the world's most fearsome assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:47.59,Flashback,MENTOR,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Xue. My beloved disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,...Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:51.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:01.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh... Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sorry for just barging in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:08.15,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Something didn't seem right earlier, \Nso I came to check on you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You were groaning a lot in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.27,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:27.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,U-Um, M-Ms. Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:35.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I fully understand that \NI may be troubling you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:37.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:44.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please let me stay this way, \Nif only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:47.23,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:56.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Did you have another nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.34,0:15:00.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You could call it a nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:04.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but it was also something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:09.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,A dream of a distant time long past...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:13.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I can't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.26,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:25.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You know how babies stop crying \Nwhen patted on the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:29.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I heard that the patting sound \Nis similar to a mother's heartbeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:30.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,which calms them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm just repeating what \Nmy mom told me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:43.64,DefaultItalics,YUKI {M},0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi's heartbeat... \NIt's so soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:52.88,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(613,1)\bord2\fs8\pos(409.5,306)\3c&H1A1F1C&}Ogiso Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.05,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H7E8081&\3c&H312A22&}Science Room
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.05,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.85,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Yuki, you don't know anything \Nabout the Katsuda Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:16:01.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's right. I figured from the name \Nit was something festive, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.10,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:05.77,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Its official name is the \NKatsuda Grand Triple Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:09.28,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1397,1063)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\an9\c&H213A3B&\3c&H54F8F9&}Champion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:09.19,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,It's a sports festival, cultural festival, and music festival all in one—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:10.90,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,the Katsuda Festival for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.66,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1397,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H213A3B&\3c&H54F8F9&}Katsuda Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:13.66,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,It's a long-standing tradition \Nhere at Ogiso High!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:18.98,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,Each class participates in the three festivals \Nand competes in an overall ranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:24.66,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,One of the prizes given to the winning class \Nis a specially made Premium Katsuda's Sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:26.21,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,PKS for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:30.17,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That's gotta be tough for Ms. Yuki \Nto hear in her sauce-deprived state!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:33.29,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,Well, it's impossible for sophomores \Nto win the Katsuda Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:34.97,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,without knowing the ins and outs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:37.43,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,The student council president's \Nclass is bound to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:41.39,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,If we're aiming for the top, we can't afford \Nto lose at the upcoming cultural festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:43.14,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,We have to keep up with our grades, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:44.60,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Grades, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:47.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah. How did you do on the test, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I managed not to fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:50.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's a nice smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:53.96,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was hoping to avoid supplementary \Nlessons, at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm glad you didn't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.89,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That would affect your standing \Nfor the Katsuda Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:16:59.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H1C201D&\pos(515,25.5)\bord4\3c&HFAFBF9&}First Semester End Results\N+ Sports Festival Score
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H4237CB&\bord1\3c&H000000&\pos(515,53.5)}+
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H1C201D&\pos(515,72.5)\bord4\3c&HFAFBF9&}Second Semester End Results +\NCultural Festival Tournament Rank\N+ Store Profits
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H4237CB&\bord1\3c&H000000&\pos(515,116.5)}+
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H1C201D&\pos(515,135)\bord4\3c&HFAFBF9&}Third Semester End Results\N+ Music Festival Evaluation
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs22\c&H4237CB&\bord1\3c&H000000&\pos(515,164)}=
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.33,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H1C201D&\pos(515,183)\bord4\3c&HFAFBF9&}Class with Highest Overall\NScore Is the Winner
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:02.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,As you can see, the average score of the class
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:05.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,contributes to the overall ranking \Nfor the Katsuda Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:09.05,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I think our class average was about 60 percent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:12.67,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you get below a 37, \Nyou won't be eligible to participate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:15.09,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\bord2.5\an7\c&H30242D&\3c&HE5E3E3&\frz345.1\pos(177.5,14.5)}Ogiso Private High School\NSophomore Chemistry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:15.09,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\bord2.5\an7\c&H30242D&\3c&HE5E3E3&\frz345.1\pos(116,28.5)}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:15.09,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\bord2.5\an7\c&H30242D&\3c&HE5E3E3&\frz345.1\pos(156,86)}Yuki Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:18.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So for someone like me who's below average...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:20.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, wh-what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:22.77,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-It'll be okay! As long as you \Ncan maintain a passing grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:26.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,you won't be so far behind, \Nand you'll still be able to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:30.32,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Those with low test scores \Njust have to work extra hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:33.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Work extra hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will work extra hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.73,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,It seems last year, they did \Na big trivia competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:41.63,Default,KOBACHI,0,0,0,,I wonder what it'll be this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:50.53,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Katsuda Bread's in short supply right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:52.88,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,so I had a hell of a hard time \Ngetting some today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.72,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It wouldn't kill you to show \Nsome gratitude, you sauce junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.86,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:04.22,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:08.64,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Did she forget that I took Hitoyoshi \Nhostage not that long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.00,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Or does she just not see me \Nas a threat at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:13.82,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If we're done, hurry up and get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:12.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\c&H302C29&\fs12\frz232.1\fax0.25\move(441.5,240,443,230.5,442,734)}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:12.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\c&H302C29&\fs16\fax0.25\frz232.1\move(408,264.5,410.5,255,442,734)}Yui Ishii
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.46,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If I get caught doing this kind of stuff, \NI'll be in hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:17.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This isn't some black market trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.18,0:18:22.53,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Anyway, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:26.41,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I have to finish grading these tests \Nbefore gym class in fifth period.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:33.17,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi, regarding the \NKatsuda Festival from earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:37.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What kind of results would we need to \Nachieve in order for our class to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:39.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,A-Are you seriously aiming to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, I guess given your abilities \Nit might be possible, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:46.10,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We need to keep your true identity \Nhidden at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:49.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, you planning to compete \Nin the Katsuda Festival, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.09,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You know you handed in your gym class \Nwritten exam without your name on it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:54.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If you fail, you can't compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.24,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,During the test, I took a peek \Nat your answer sheet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.70,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,and noticed yours was the \Nonly one without a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.70,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\bord2.5\an7\c&H595A58&\3c&HE9E8E3&\fax-0.35\frz341.8\pos(84.5,6.5)}\hOgiso Private High School\NSophomore Health and Physical Education
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.70,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs13\bord2.5\an7\c&H595A58&\3c&HE9E8E3&\fax-0.35\frz341.8\pos(344.5,85)}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:04.16,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\an7\c&H191A1F&\frz15.2\pos(265,121)}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:04.16,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,So this one has to be yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.33,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, that's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:09.08,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You would've passed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:13.38,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, you get an A+ in physical ability, so it \Nshouldn't affect your grades proper, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:18.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was a fool to be grateful \Nto someone like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.34,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't give me that! \NYou have only yourself to blame here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:25.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... Would it be possible for you \Nto allow her to write her name in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.25,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:30.13,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You really think I'm gonna cut you \Nsuch a sweet deal for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:31.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:35.06,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll let you get out of flunking the exam... \Nif you do a job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.98,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't ask you to kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:41.11,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,And of course, I'll be terminating \Nour Katsuda Bread deal, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:42.74,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Also, one more condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:45.69,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,When you go to a ramen joint, \Nyou gotta leave the sauce at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.69,0:19:47.66,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're still stewing on that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.76,0:19:50.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I suppose sacrifices must be made...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:51.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:53.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You can't give in to her coercive tactics!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:00.89,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:01.90,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.72,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(151,1)\an7\c&H24231E&\fs16\pos(327,53.5)}Name\N{\fnComic Sans MS\fs30}Yuki Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:05.72,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,What? Her name is filled in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.10,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.97,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,What kind of magic trick was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:09.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:11.23,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:14.32,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's clear to me now that Ms. Grace \Nwas simply mistaken to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:17.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,We could even say she was seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.27,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Your name was already on \Nthe paper from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:22.99,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I see you're starting to grow a spine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.20,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:29.64,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll let you go this time, \Nbut I won't be so lenient in future!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:30.92,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You got that, sauce junkie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:37.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I hate to put it like this, \Nbut Ms. Grace is pretty easy—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:39.07,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I heard that, Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:46.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So, how {\i1}did{\i0} you do it, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Well, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:57.23,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I hope I was able to be \Nof some use to Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:21:00.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes. You were very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:04.01,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:07.23,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You're in our class, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:09.65,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Um... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:11.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Hikage?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.44,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:19.20,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,Oh... Um... I... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:22.28,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I'm Naka Hikage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.13,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.34,Default,NAKA,0,0,0,,I know a way we can win the Cultural Festival!
